# Environment examples are release inputs; actual environment files are local.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.production.example
!**/.env.*.example
**/vendor/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
